{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "e267e686d780188bd101d616ea761962bc7638646f3dd1064b9062c55760e4ca", "ja": "密着！　アイドルの本音に迫れ！", "zh": "紧密跟拍！逼近偶像的真心话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dbc09097c7a089a10fa56e59c34d84f1d6b71b324442b0eed5e70c0c8df4a5c3", "ja": "短期特番打ち合せ前、アイドル達に初回の\n感想を尋ねるプロデューサー。番組内容が\n直接BOTの結果に影響しそうな事を心配\nするメンバー。プロデューサーは好感度を\n削るより上げるために頑張ろうと励ます。", "zh": "在短期特别节目策划会议前，制作人向偶像们询问第一次的感想。成员们担心节目内容会直接影响BOT的结果。制作人鼓励大家，要努力提升好感度，而不是让它下降。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0d41b91b609adebcefc56fa51d13f6146cd397a62104a94440677b9d831c96e4", "ja": "（『BATTLE OF THEATER』短期特番の\n打ち合わせで、メンバーに集まってもらった）", "zh": "（在《BATTLE OF THEATER》短期特别节目的筹备会上，大家聚到了一起）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1f802b954f305ec238e718a9433bee5a6a9a11f7ac2377a07a1c98be84b4dc05", "ja": "それじゃ、この日程という事で。\nレッスンもあって忙しいだろうけど、よろしくな！", "zh": "那就按这个日程安排。\n虽然大家还有课程，应该会很忙，但就拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "35a12e5cce7a468ca658867260e0a5ffb2b4265a7d7253fc14f834df5b5ba648", "ja": "大丈夫です！　もっと忙しくてもいけます！", "zh": "没问题！再忙我也撑得住！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "a5be35f5a5012ab9564ef5b03a80c6d217675b642d34fdc70f700fc5a82307ff", "ja": "いやいやいや。茜ちゃんたち、耐久レースとかしてる\nわけじゃないからね？　無理はしないでおこうね！", "zh": "不不不，小茜她们又不是在参加耐力赛，对吧？还是别勉强自己了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ea96fa652987819c4da10f4cd7d43d2095f1d44453d601a6935b2d5287b4f738", "ja": "はは、そうだな！　ところで今回の番組について、\nまだ撮影の感想を聞いてなかったな。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是！对了，这次节目的拍摄感想，我还没问过呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3b677b1bdcc19dbbe2076c1a81515b5be906c979e93d5dc3e8ea536d240cbfd2", "ja": "みんなの手ごたえとしては、どうだ？\n率直な意見を聞かせてほしい。", "zh": "大家感觉如何？\n告诉我你们最真实的想法吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "dbe3dc77009e065618dfaaa3c75d7c5da0248671307fcbca1e62ed38ea09f4f5", "ja": "どうだ？　じゃないよ～、\n{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "才不是“怎么样”呢～，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "1c3ff4706909d13c01b7ebb8a5e9bf02f73fe9e39d51488fa10c503ab0d08a9b", "ja": "ホントだよね！　{$P$}、\nひとりで気楽なんだから～！", "zh": "就是嘛！{$P$}，一个人多自在啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c1def23ba3d87797311bb648c557c95661ad3ca6c3591ced7cde2b5d0fa65dbb", "ja": "えっ！？　何か問題があったか？\n内容とか……？", "zh": "诶！？是出了什么问题吗？\n内容之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "0e3492045faef4a9c9f85a712ad4426efa2dafe50defd0d22bb8ccbd7d59b259", "ja": "いや、内容は面白かったよ？　ノリもまぁ、\n慣れれば昔のテレビっぽい感じかな？　って。", "zh": "没有啦，内容挺有意思的哦？节奏也还算……\n要是习惯了，感觉蛮有以前电视节目的味道吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "f5f3077574cc35292b2f9007af9853a373505fbe7104ce466952c13551b9ea79", "ja": "さっきも、3人で話してたんですけど。\n今の時期にあの内容は、かなり攻めてるかなって……。", "zh": "刚才我们3个人也聊到过，不过……以现在这个时期来说，那种内容是不是有点太大胆了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "335e01e38c6431a1c079e008f0377c91c331697d82d81614e7fa4b6c1c8eb67b", "ja": "ふむ？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "f7e1ab3d0f35fda7be515e0d08645430e3323e43d12472963cf7408f71e8b8a9", "ja": "アタシたち、大事なバトルを控えてるんだよ？\nそのタイミングで、好感度チェックの番組って……。", "zh": "我们可是要迎来一场重要的战斗哦？\n在这种时候，居然要上测好感度的节目……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "bb8fc35468e45f9c0433f8e3b007125403b5305d165844f7b8790b54efbdf729", "ja": "そんなの、絶対投票に影響するじゃ～ん！！", "zh": "那绝对会影响投票结果吧～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "f687bd8c9f2a871a8e2c0724bf90ab356d65f76cbebc8d9db99ebc785318eac8", "ja": "そう！　つまりこれは、ただのバラエティじゃない……\nお互いの好感度を削り合う、仁義なきバトルなのだー！", "zh": "没错！也就是说，这可不只是普通的综艺节目……\n而是互相削减好感度的不讲仁义之战——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b9939dc69c1b17304e6663738b6b72b9d4f24beecb5e499cc136544876444ad2", "ja": "好感度を削るんじゃなくて、\nそれぞれ、上げてもらうための企画だけどな！", "zh": "不是去削减好感度，\n而是为了让各自的好感度都提升的企划好吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "420c050d2aff0db677c93b509e8aa35bef948f0e6510a270f30e869d51cb8559", "ja": "とはいえ、番組側にも狙いはあると思う。\n駆け引きがあった方が、勝負は盛り上がるからな。", "zh": "话虽如此，我觉得节目组应该也有自己的盘算。\n毕竟有些博弈，比赛才会更精彩嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "4c01deb4167288469a5e19a1e4ac1dc68efe6d30ec509eb5605b9915da2f146d", "ja": "やっぱり、そういうことなんですね。番組に\n取り上げてもらえるのは、ありがたいんですけど……。", "zh": "果然是这么回事啊。能被节目选中报道，我是很感激的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "5c7e7bbee606ce8b6533013af8d6528e1947b3feb67bc1d0195c102d12c4e65b", "ja": "番組の結果が、勝敗に直接影響しそうで。\nプレッシャーが……。", "zh": "感觉节目结果可能会直接影响胜负。\n压力好大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "2ff091830c747f4b4dc2c9ce7f7b29d00ae57d3bcc6704e2cf6b4ffede75bd57", "ja": "個人戦じゃなくて、チーム戦だしね！\nいくら茜ちゃんでも気にしちゃうよ？　ちょっとはね？", "zh": "毕竟不是个人赛，而是团队赛嘛！就算是小茜，也会在意的吧？多少还是会在意一点吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cd35bf420b55ab19313f20afc047f8c06e59f95739152dd9106f0e57ed24cd63", "ja": "そうだな。あまりBOTの勝敗を意識せず……\nというのは、流石に難しいよな。", "zh": "是啊。要完全不去在意BOT的胜负……\n果然还是很难做到吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "99a2a395bd1a222658c78fa93e02c5b0b389c7fa8525e7885b3834adf1461d4e", "ja": "いや無理だってば！　そんな器用なこと。", "zh": "不行啦！那种灵巧的事，我可做不到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c73131acee86fa578e1eda2b754cb1ed9c0cdaafe6f9ae8adb06151b063f226b", "ja": "すまない。とはいえ、撮影した内容は\n全部チェックしてるし、信用してくれていい。", "zh": "抱歉。不过，拍摄的内容我都有全部检查过，你可以相信我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "55e5b2cfb030e6c99c900ab17668dce64d0397756a96c037184fc79755dcb079", "ja": "好感度を気にするのは、本当なら裏方の仕事だ。\nだから皆はそのままの自分で、全力でやって欲しい！", "zh": "在意好感度这种事，本来应该是幕后人员的工作。\n所以希望大家只要做真实的自己，全力以赴就好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "fa684a2964dd32e0962a86e4c2cf167e9d57dd3da7425ad395696b8ebef07cd2", "ja": "{$P$}がそう言うなら……\nわかりました！　全力で挑むのは得意ですから。", "zh": "既然{$P$}这么说……  \n明白了！我最擅长全力以赴地挑战了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "25763c4bfea068039907143dd6c7baef6a26be31d7a8584a79eb4170677b1343", "ja": "私は、いつもの私らしく……それで行きます！", "zh": "我就做平时的我……就这么上了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "1ca51ea95a5aea5eb1fcb6bb488d3b7a0822afa2e2c87778fdfcfadf2b9f94a0", "ja": "しょうがないニャー、それなら見せてあげよう……\n茜ちゃんの、本気のバラエティーというものを！", "zh": "真拿你没办法喵，那就让你见识一下……小茜真正的综艺节目是什么样的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "ae3369803d403b49807d9e33e6525cb1586c808e3d39f2acdf1b6f8a4be66f57", "ja": "ま、結局それしかないか。\nちゃんとフォローしてよね～？　にゃはは。", "zh": "嗯，结果也只能这样了。\n可要好好配合我哦～？呀哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "7f72e850e0b9aacb27da1ed5fdc3623adbfd8b06d93cf0f013ec253fcd2c85b0", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう、3人とも。", "zh": "啊，谢谢你们，3位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "617d4721239730332e9c5faa6d88015c808f420ccad0046b5e177b6af0e6ab1f", "ja": "あ、ねえねえ{$P$}ちゃん！\nできれば、次の番組内容を知っておきたいんだけど。", "zh": "啊，对了对了，{$P$}！\n可以的话，我想提前知道下期节目的内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1030_027say", "source_sha256": "85d9ab558a47458d87c850afbd85018fe9c1c475862c3003e07b0c800484893f", "ja": "そうだね！　覚悟を決めるためにも……。\n内容、もう決まってたりしますか？　テーマだけでも。", "zh": "没错！为了做好心理准备……节目的内容已经定下来了吗？哪怕只知道主题也好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "0fa32021b89b524f81182b938f051801a7492d5fa11d02eb1d7979ea36d9753f", "ja": "ああ、まだ仮だけど、概要はもらってるよ。\nええと……。", "zh": "啊，还只是暂定的，不过大致内容已经拿到了。\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "34567fa3d3a96f18b51e26557d9fcb9017ddce09957018f890deab48d23abc8b", "ja": "『リアルドッキリ企画、試される友情！』\n……という企画らしい。", "zh": "“真实整蛊企划，考验友情！”\n……好像是这么个企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1033_027say", "source_sha256": "eca7c150a93d76a933dbcd78bd2419323d2137484f6e806f504c0966d6e986a6", "ja": "ええ～……。", "zh": "诶～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "eca7c150a93d76a933dbcd78bd2419323d2137484f6e806f504c0966d6e986a6", "ja": "ええ～……。", "zh": "诶～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_02_1035_020meg", "source_sha256": "eca7c150a93d76a933dbcd78bd2419323d2137484f6e806f504c0966d6e986a6", "ja": "ええ～……。", "zh": "诶～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
